		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A huge, animated snakeskin covered with barbs. Crafted from giant snake skins by viperian necromancers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +7 (2d10) and 1 draining coils, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Aura of Dust</strong>. Mortals within near of hollow serpent at start of turn CON 15+ or 1d6 STR damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Draining Coils</strong>. Contested STR to constrict and hold target immobile for one round. Constricted mortals, at start of turn CON 15+ or 1d6 STR damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Supreme Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
